[{"title":"于家陂","author":"吴与弼","text":"儿童随伯氏，渔此供宾庖。\n江湖四十载，往迹惟神交。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9543,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陀上","author":"吴与弼","text":"迢迢陀上路，东去通康庄。\n当年断肠别，观者同彷徨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承临川县侯李降临弊庐赐以高邮米麻姑酒喜与邻里乡党共分其惠因成此句","author":"吴与弼","text":"泥尊满贮旴江绿，玉粒遥传淮甸香。\n白屋荣沾花县赐，喜从乡党一分尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留赠湖田万氏 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"病违佳约卧柴荆，虚辱衣冠事远迎。\n绿酒喜陪今夕话，又将迂阔渎高听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留赠湖田万氏 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"朝来听取别时歌，善恶由来不共科。\n欲向事几明摆析，工夫不厌读书多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠故里亲友","author":"吴与弼","text":"跋涉西还访旧居，故人心绪总何如。\n平生拙学无他技，到处逢人劝读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柏堂","author":"吴与弼","text":"灵根亲傍陇头安，翠盖凌空已郁盘。\n岁月岂胜和泪数，风霜几向断肠看。\n苦心循是天真易，峻节当兹末俗难。\n珍重贤郎能不匮，高堂特笔障狂澜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉谢诸乡邻","author":"吴与弼","text":"草堂遥复种湖滨，此地相将二百春。\n出处无能惭德义，往来盛礼谢乡邻。\n从今厚俗虽交善，自古为居必择仁。\n海内喜瞻声教远，时雍共作太平民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小年夜绝句","author":"吴与弼","text":"煌煌银烛照良宵，乐此升平荷圣朝。\n门户恍思前甲子，肃然世泽感迢遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除日","author":"吴与弼","text":"此地栖迟忽岁除，萍踪如梦对琴书。\n宗门一一经过处，共喜云孙复故居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"妻子团栾身少瘥，故居风景庆时和。\n老年襟抱无他感，但恨读书功不多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄谢杨宪副赠周礼注疏","author":"吴与弼","text":"梦寐周公制作心，遗编厚贶辱遥临。\n焚香拜罢时开卷，感激于君定几深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题太古轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"轩前化日正迟迟，轩里幽人自得时。\n一曲云和春万顷，杳然身世在皇羲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种湖","author":"吴与弼","text":"湖久难稽得种名，乡邻聊共古今称。\n我来几度游湖畔，何限徘徊异世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大桥","author":"吴与弼","text":"乡里流传小小孤，众流挟束帖如无。\n伊人何自卑其局，试问为仁安属乎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何陂","author":"吴与弼","text":"万顷汪洋浸白云，潜滋暗助发生仁。\n试于翘望云霓处，始见深功信有神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江家山","author":"吴与弼","text":"清眺长便山外山，层峦叠嶂巧回环。\n个中自有无穷趣，不惜芒鞋数往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城上松","author":"吴与弼","text":"隐隐东南几万松，翠华如涌四时同。\n高标独傲冰霜表，生意都归雨露中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读春秋","author":"吴与弼","text":"世情诗思两悠悠，老去何心复梦周。\n风雨午窗春睡起，间将吾志向春秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自讼","author":"吴与弼","text":"徒尔昂藏生世间，可怜此志久希颜。\n如何白发龙钟际，依旧身心就检难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约","author":"吴与弼","text":"为恶都缘自放多，私根随处费消磨。\n从今要术须归约，履薄临深养太和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆大参赐胙","author":"吴与弼","text":"画省颁膰到荜门，极知雅意笃斯文。\n独惭浅薄将焉称，细与乡邻族党论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题石宪使慈寿堂","author":"吴与弼","text":"西山淑气蔼蓬莱，华馆春风寿域开。\n信是深功由我积，固应馀庆自天来。\n兰阶綵绣荣南服，锦巷珠玑应上台。\n疏薄岂胜膺授简，日同黎庶仰崇台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王太守荣满","author":"吴与弼","text":"皂盖朝天日，黎民卧辙时。\n重临俱有望，竹马候归期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示儿","author":"吴与弼","text":"青灯父子话从容，贫贱逾知乐意浓。\n从此莫忘慈教旨，诗书宜早用深功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丰安道中","author":"吴与弼","text":"宿雨初收淑气回，春山归兴正悠哉。\n云烟处处依微敛，桃李家家自在开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"养拙柴门日久沉，子勤习诵父哦吟。\n始知陋巷箪瓢乐，千载同符只此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉寄家兄","author":"吴与弼","text":"独居迢递忆吾兄，犹记当年童稚情。\n万事相看俱潦倒，流光如梦迹如萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄胡子贞","author":"吴与弼","text":"谬为何自可成章，半百年华感兴长。\n惆怅故人头总白，青山归梦绕莲塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼寝偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"老境日向逼，学业靡所成。\n空想古英哲，怅然念平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子贞及一舍弟送归途中口号","author":"吴与弼","text":"久客欣逢故里游，山中风景值清秋。\n怡怡切切偲偲处，指点归途去复休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿湖头","author":"吴与弼","text":"野境云俱暝，江空雨未休。\n问程频策马，灯火宿湖头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游瓜石感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶尔驱驰此地过，故人消息近如何。\n短筇白发遥相迓，暗忆流年一掷梭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿胡氏梅竹轩九韶季恒在焉","author":"吴与弼","text":"梅竹幽栖处，良朋偶盍簪。\n留连清夜饮，俛仰莫年心。\n明日又南北，转头成古今。\n平生江海梦，偏向旧游深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望家山感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"望望家山近故丘，西风疋马怅高秋。\n旧游历历人如梦，昨日少年今白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"十载劳经营，得卜寒泉麓。\n虽乏囊中资，幸安一茅屋。\n桃李君自花，风月吾人独。\n侨居非素心，言归事耕读。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"我居清溪曲，绕屋罗青山。\n白云自来往，脩竹无柴关。\n翘企古人躅，逸驾容追攀。\n悠然一瓢饮，不知有尘寰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其三","author":"吴与弼","text":"莫春春服成，嬉游吾所爱。\n至哉浴沂心，斯言不下带。\n浩荡六合间，彻视宁有碍。\n何事千载馀，兹境稀能会。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其四","author":"吴与弼","text":"夙昔闻太华，耸拔何其尊。\n未遑游汗漫，流传少陵君。\n群峰无远近，环立皆儿孙。\n何当脱尘鞅，胜览跻青云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其五","author":"吴与弼","text":"樗散竟奚为，无禽怜旧井。\n夙志成蹉跎，星流百年景。\n俯仰起遐思，空嗟圣途永。\n闭关事微阳，残魂此其幸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其六","author":"吴与弼","text":"我思君子为，洪钧岂小补。\n化日舒以长，仁风被寰宇。\n下视驩娱如，区区焉足数。\n安得千载人，谁知此心苦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其七","author":"吴与弼","text":"王者大如何，乾元物资始。\n亭?一何心，家家自桃李。\n固不令人怒，亦不令人喜。\n帝力何有哉，皞皞皆仁里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其八","author":"吴与弼","text":"素心在丘壑，衡茅隐松萝。\n时访李邺侯，或亲郭橐驼。\n空谷响樵唱，绿野喧农歌。\n暝然日之夕，不乐复如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其九","author":"吴与弼","text":"恭默观我生，兢兢虞逐物。\n立志在有为，固当有所不。\n图史娱朝昏，云霞媚岩窟。\n吾道卜终焉，何心于象笏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和刘秀野诗韵 其十","author":"吴与弼","text":"人生何所贵，贵在为丈夫。\n古今表表者，脂韦岂良图。\n风霜竹凌厉，冰雪梅清癯。\n壮志一少懈，焉足为有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿楼府庵中 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"客路忻同胜友行，贪看山水一身轻。\n幽栖远就云林宿，明月清风万古情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿楼府庵中 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"歇马高林见水源，时从明月咏潺湲。\n不知浩荡沧溟上，万折东趋路几千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿格山禅林寺","author":"吴与弼","text":"骑从劳英友，秋山共客游。\n禅窗无寐处，竹月涌寒流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"日斜马滑惊危石，路暗人疲怯败桥。\n雷电屡防风雨至，须臾明月露青霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉寄黄泰庄先辈","author":"吴与弼","text":"惆怅白头吟，云山契阔深。\n何当重剪烛，细叙百年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"清觉当凉夜，灵台正静虚。\n寒光皎残月，星象烂联珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬黄季恒","author":"吴与弼","text":"连日青山共好怀，胜游清话两悠哉。\n诗筒又促乘流约，佳骑明朝来未来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次打石港感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"不出门庭十五年，旧游遥历重凄然。\n昂藏徒有平生志，容易因循雪满颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璿庆同余李友登陆游憩","author":"吴与弼","text":"童冠相呼六七朋，晴沙迤逦并舟行。\n个中真意人谁会，慨想当年与点情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐偶成","author":"吴与弼","text":"曝背墙头独咏诗，风帆远近鸟差池。\n江干举目皆真乐，底事人心苦自私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发桂家林","author":"吴与弼","text":"故人迎候暂维舟，行李匆匆去莫留。\n白首相逢多病后，西风斜日两绸缪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿池港","author":"吴与弼","text":"卧病衡茅久自私，懒心只与白云宜。\n那知风雨江湖夜，恍似平生涉历时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓬漏不堪坐起赋此以慰余李诸友","author":"吴与弼","text":"风雨疏蓬共不眠，可怜此志在希贤。\n谁能万一朱夫子，林范何劳远接联。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次桃树港与璿庆登岸閒眺","author":"吴与弼","text":"忆昨儿童随伯氏，趋庭曾此系扁舟。\n重来俯仰悲华发，碌碌空过四十秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿板溪 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"离却蓬窗宿此溪，青灯华屋又吾伊。\n芳筵倦酌辞清醑，随意閒裁听雨诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿板溪 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"诗罢吾伊尚未停，拥炉更喜共残灯。\n工夫似此能无间，何患当年艺不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿板溪 其三","author":"吴与弼","text":"跋涉长途未觉疲，晦明不必问前期。\n寸心始觉元无外，万事须知各有宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辞李氏宴","author":"吴与弼","text":"特感华筵美意深，不才自分实难任。\n平生非欲多违忤，恐负区区雅素心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中见梅","author":"吴与弼","text":"虬枝忽见雪交加，自在芳心阅岁华。\n客里但贪春意好，短墙不必问谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望豫章城怀胡祭酒先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"行行渐近豫章城，烟树微茫两眼青。\n野水平桥时独立，肃然起敬为先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"璿庆失金","author":"吴与弼","text":"人亡人得不须怜，佩服嘉谟亦有年。\n今日失金何足较，自当观理学前贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿悬榻里有怀往事","author":"吴与弼","text":"尘世悠悠几古今，偶投仁里一沉吟。\n山川孕秀知多少，何事先生得独深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拜胡祭酒先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"一拜膺门百感并，归来犹自怅平生。\n客窗展转难成寐，风雨萧萧永夜心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留题伍氏馆","author":"吴与弼","text":"琴书信宿托高轩，细接襟期意豁然。\n堂上埙篪春似海，阶前梧竹碧参天。\n江山映带供真趣，田圃萦环庆有年。\n不待有心行乐事，自然至乐日无边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"苦心遥夜独观生，时听书声杂雨声。\n但得晴明游览毕，青山回首数归程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜晴","author":"吴与弼","text":"晨起呼童问晦明，遥天红碧报新晴。\n江山豫有登临约，何处凭高一畅情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游孺子亭次朱子诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"孺子高风固莫寻，紫阳馀韵感人深。\n乾坤那得有今古，千载斯人只此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿豫章城","author":"吴与弼","text":"白发悲心事，青阳逼岁除。\n江城回客枕，寒漏四更馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9615,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉次胡祭酒先生诗韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"抠趋百里亲先执，犹是当年老长官。\n绛帐春风酣德教，红炉瑞气盛杯盘。\n客边病思饥应忘，江上归心岁已残。\n拜得新诗缘路读，梅花冰雪为谁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9616,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问舟南浦","author":"吴与弼","text":"客里逢人漫说诗，从教归计尚迟迟。\n时将泽国天然趣，指点苍茫一教儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9617,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发南浦示璿庆及诸生","author":"吴与弼","text":"细雨斜风竹叶舟，长蓑短笠溯寒流。\n呼儿又喜新诗就，丽泽何妨迭倡酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9618,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野宿","author":"吴与弼","text":"满江风雨泊孤舟，舴艋能生逆旅愁。\n伫立渐看西北好，一天明月乱云收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9619,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下行舟","author":"吴与弼","text":"客衾局促难安枕，夜半孤舟带月操。\n童仆总知归去好，寒汀鱼贯不辞劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9620,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]